WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:40.290
With their sights set
on becoming great generals,

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:44.910
Shin and young rivals Ou Hon
and Mou Ten played off each other

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.750
to rack up victories on the battlefield.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:51.790
Meanwhile, an unusual situation was
unfolding in the Chin capital of Kanyou.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:56.370
Messengers from the forbidden
Inner Palace appeared with a letter

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:59.540
sealed with a duplicate of the Imperial Seal.

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:03.250
With Ryo Fui's faction raging
against the King and his allies,

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.500
it was as if Sei's mother, the Queen Dowager,

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:10.620
was presenting herself as a
new third force in the struggle.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:16.160
The Inner Palace is our third force?!

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:19.450
Why didn't you say so?

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:23.290
Surely the King's mother, the Queen Dowager,

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.790
would take our side if we but asked.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.120
If it were that easy,

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.000
we would have already done so.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.910
My lord, what do you--

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:36.410
Heki.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:37.500
Sire!

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:40.790
Things... aren't that simple.

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.370
My mother and I...

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:57.870
Mother?

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.330
Stay out!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:21.220
"Exquisite Poison"

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.290
You there!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.290
Madam?

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.040
All those present, you may lift your heads.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:52.790
This was Sei's mother, the Queen Dowager.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.910
A former courtesan who
captivated monarchs of the time,

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:06.750
a beauty so bewitching
she endangered the nation.

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.500
The Queen Dowager appeared so youthful,

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.750
rumors held that she never aged.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.580
She was surrounded by an
impossible glamour all her own.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:23.410
The King's mother... She's so beautiful.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.540
But why is it...

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:31.000
I know this is rude of me...
but whenever I see the Queen Dowager,

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:34.200
I sense no human warmth from her.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.200
And that's why...

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.700
...all of the court ladies here
fear that stunning Queen Dowager

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:45.580
from the bottoms of their hearts.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:51.660
Thus far we have not involved the Inner Palace

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:55.580
so as to keep the Queen Dowager's
influence away from matters of state.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:05:00.080
bakki of ka, Dakki of Shou, Hou Ji of Shuu--

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.250
though these were all concubines,
not Queen Dowagers,

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:06.160
it is said their negative
influence on the Imperial Court

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.870
proved the downfall of the rulers of their day.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:13.660
When women from outside the Court
get involved in Court matters,

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.000
calamity ensues.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.910
Worse, the Inner Palace
is also a nest of eunuchs

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:22.450
who shrewdly curry favor with the Queen Dowager.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.080
If we bring her into our fold,
they will naturally follow suit.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:32.500
And the Inner Palace is protected
by special extraterritorial rights.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:36.750
Once they are given power here,
they will be difficult to control.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:41.870
All this explains why even Ryo Fui
has not yet approached them.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:45.410
The Queen Dowager has remained
indifferent to affairs of the Court

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.500
and silent on the struggle
between Ryo Shi's faction and the King.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:53.040
But for her to send this

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:57.330
may be construed as
indicating a certain attitude.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.620
What on earth could it contain?

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.450
Break the seal, Shi Shi.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.250
Wh-What is this?!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.160
Gotcha!

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.750
Minister, sir.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.040
We have received a slightly odd report.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.000
What is it?

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:09.450
A messenger from the Inner Palace
called upon Shi Shi yesterday.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.080
Is this true?

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.080
Yes, sir.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.790
Find out more.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:14.410
Yes, sir!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.660
And don't forget to step up
surveillance on both of them.

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:19.000
Sir!

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:25.580
The Inner Palace, eh?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:29.910
A rather tricky player is making a move...

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:31.080
Shi Shi!

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:32.790
What did the Queen Dowager say?!

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.000
It's blank!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.870
Nothing written there at all!

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:42.330
What?!

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.620
Wh-What on earth...?

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:47.250
What could this mean?

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:50.000
It could be taken as a mere prank,

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:55.870
or as saying she cannot decide
which of the two sides to take.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.120
Your Highness...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.250
I am of the same opinion as Shou Bun Kun.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:04.660
Does this not mean that she is
currently a neutral party?

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:09.370
We cannot judge her heart of hearts so easily.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:15.200
Although I, too, believe the
blank paper indicates her neutrality...

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:19.200
I sense it carries an altogether
different meaning as well.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:22.450
That woman is inscrutable...

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.620
They must be all worked up right about now.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:51.700
Do you know why I did what I did, Chou Kou?

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:52.830
No, madam.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:57.750
I thought not. I don't know myself.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.620
You there!

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:00.290
Madam!

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:03.830
Next I'll take what you've tasted...

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.450
straight from your lips.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.580
B-But...

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.790
Hurry, now.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.620
Y-Yes, madam!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:34.410
I look forward to seeing
where things go from here.

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:10.580
What kind of man

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:15.040
has that greasy-haired,
nasty-eyed brat become?

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.290
With this letter,

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:21.750
what is of most import is the seal.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.000
Her intent in affixing
a duplicate of the Royal Seal

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:27.160
and sending it there is clear enough.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:32.410
She sent it knowing we
could not simply cast it aside.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:37.120
She is telling us to look toward
the power of the Inner Palace.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.540
Unmistakably so.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.620
Your Highness,

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:47.120
as you know, beneath the
Queen Dowager are three ladies in waiting

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:53.120
backed by three major royal houses:
Han, Kai, and Ryou.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:55.450
These powerful figures have
secretly supported the Inner Palace

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:58.370
since olden times.

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:02.790
The inherited power
they possess is different still,

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:06.120
but if we make them our allies,
we will hold nearly half of the power

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.160
in this struggle with Ryo Fui.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:13.750
However... should they side
with Ryo Shi's faction instead,

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:17.160
we will have no way whatsoever to resist them.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.330
One way or another, we must deal with them.

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:26.700
Perhaps we should resign
ourselves to bringing them on board.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.080
I object!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.200
My lord?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.830
It pains me to say this before His Highness,

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.950
knowing full well the
insolence I display in so doing:

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:40.540
The Queen Dowager is poison!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:44.120
True, the three royal houses are powerful,

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:49.450
but they are also the venomous fangs
at the Queen Dowager's beck and call!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:53.660
Although simple addition
implies our power would increase,

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:57.290
I fear their involvement would
provide only the smallest influence

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:00.790
against Ryo Shi's faction in the end!

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.500
Then what do you suggest we do?

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:05.290
What if we ignore them and they align with Ryo Shi?!

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:08.000
No one's saying we should ignore them!

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.790
Shou Bun Kun is merely pointing out the danger

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.580
in so readily joining forces with them!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.870
But with the arrival of this letter,
surely we must do <i>something</i> !

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.950
"Queen Dowager"

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.330
Um...

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:37.620
Is Your Highness tired today?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:38.950
Why do you ask?

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:44.450
It's just... Your Highness seems different.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:48.080
You do look at me quite often, don't you.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:52.160
N-No, I just, I-I--

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.660
No reading tonight, I think.

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:59.330
I'm sorry for always having you
only sit beside me, Kou.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:03.000
N-Not at all...

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:07.540
Is... is this it? Am I about to...
with His Highness...?

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:11.080
Oh, You--say a little
prayer that all goes well!

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.870
Will you talk with me?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:19.580
What was your mother like?

00:13:19.580 --> 00:13:23.330
My... My mother?

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.580
Yes. Tell me about her.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.330
Let's see...

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:33.080
I came from a poor merchant family.
My mother is small like me,

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:36.910
and works herself into a sweat
every day running the shop.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.910
She's scatterbrained, soft-hearted...

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:41.910
Not beautiful at all.

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.910
And do you love her, a mother like that?

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:49.950
Yes. When I see her, all she
does is complain. And yet...

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:53.580
...ever since I came to the Inner Palace,
we almost never meet.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:56.870
Somehow, even her nagging cheers me now.

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:01.500
I see. That's a good relationship you two have.

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:09.370
Your Highness's mother is so beautiful.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.290
But...

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.500
Nothing...

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:16.660
That's right--you have seen her.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:19.200
How is she? My mother, the Queen Dowager?

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:23.120
She is well. Your Highness does not see her?

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:26.370
It's been a long time.

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:27.950
Why is that?

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:32.200
Surely Your Highness could see
the Queen Dowager at any time.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:37.540
A normal King and Queen Dowager, maybe.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:41.160
But we are not normal.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.160
Our relationship makes it
difficult for us even to meet.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.660
The King?

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.120
What?!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.410
The King--in the Inner Palace?!

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:12.450
H-He's gone to meet with
the Queen Dowager in person?

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:16.620
Quite unexpected for him
to act without consulting you.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:19.870
My lord!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:26.330
Er... no, no--this is between
the King and the Queen Dowager.

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:29.700
Tell me one thing, my lord:

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.790
Why would the Queen Dowager,
the King's mother,

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:36.250
not come to his aid in the first place?

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:40.000
What could have happened between them?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:44.450
All that is between them is the
memory of their time as hostages

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:48.160
in Kantan, the capital of Sho.

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.700
In short,

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:53.160
they share only darkness.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:58.660
I know that the King lived
in Sho until the age of nine,

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:02.290
and that he endured daily insults
and cruelty as a prince of Chin,

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.870
Sho's sworn enemy in the Battle of Chouhei.

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:11.620
Is that not all the more reason
for her to be a protective, loving mother?

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:15.660
The suffering the Queen Dowager
endured was even greater.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.790
Her husband, King Sou Jou, had fled to Chin.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:27.370
Left helpless and alone,
she detested everyone around her.

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:30.370
And I do mean <i>everyone</i> .

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:33.410
Thus hardened by the way people treated her,

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:35.910
something in the Queen Dowager snapped.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:39.330
And then...

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:40.620
...in the end...

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:46.040
...she lashed out at her own child.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.040
Sei. Sei. Die.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.410
But that's ridiculous!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:17:00.330
What mother would try
to kill her own child? Unbelievable!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.580
And the King endured all that?!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:10.290
He recovered well from this
harsh period of his younger years.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:15.330
One woman risked her life
to rescue the King from this darkness.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:22.000
If it weren't for her, he could
very well still be there today.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.040
However...

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:27.660
it cast a great pall on the
relationship between the King

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.040
and the Queen Dowager,
where it remains to this day.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:34.500
For such two to meet face to face...

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:39.120
Frankly, I cannot fathom
where their conversation will lead.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.500
Come now, Sei. This is our first
meeting in such a long while.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.700
Won't you come closer?

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:55.080
Or are you afraid of this mother of yours?

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:56.080
No...

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.790
Closer, now...

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.700
Closer...

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.660
Closer...

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:21.290
Closer!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.950
That's my son for you.

00:18:33.950 --> 00:18:38.700
I don't see you for a while,
and look what a fine man you've become,

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.580
Sei.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:43.790
And you, Mother, have not changed.

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:53.290
To think <i>you</i> would ever come and see <i>me</i> ...

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:58.040
This is all just as you
pictured it, isn't it, Chou Kou?

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.870
N-No, not at all.

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:01.500
Chou Kou...

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.700
And? What brings you here, Sei?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.290
Please stop playing dumb, Mother.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:12.000
I have come to retrieve
the duplicate Royal Seal.

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:15.540
Your prank has gone too far.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:20.500
If this matter were to come to light,
you would be accused of treason.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:25.200
Treason? How tragic!

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:31.080
But don't you think it strange
that the word "treason"

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.620
would come up between us?

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:40.080
After the life we led together in Sho?

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.330
When you and I were in Kantan...

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:48.290
...the attacks on us were beyond all belief.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.250
With no way to raise money,

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:53.370
we both lowered ourselves
just to eke out a living.

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:59.290
<i>Literally</i> lowered ourselves--
crawling along the ground itself!

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:02.540
But where are those two now?

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:07.160
You are the King of Chin,
and I the Queen Dowager!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:11.370
Formally speaking, we stand
at the very top of this nation,

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:16.330
the highest stations, with none above us.

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:20.870
What a twist of fate!

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:26.000
A scholar once said that
the heavens decide our destiny.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.410
But if that is true...

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.370
...I want to tear the heavens asunder
as long as this curse remains!

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:43.370
You feel the same, don't you, Sei?

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:48.910
Let me tell you, Chou Kou:
We have not attempted to see one another

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:53.120
because we do not wish
to remember those hellish days.

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:55.330
Correct, Sei?

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:59.080
Please return the duplicate Seal, Mother.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:00.950
Hmph. The Seal, eh?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:03.580
Who cares about that toy?

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:08.120
If you want it, take it from
the eunuchs on your way out.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:12.750
What <i>is</i> all this, Mother?
Why do such a thing, out of the blue?

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.200
No reason.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:18.700
I only wanted to see your
face again, after all this time.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.750
Then if you'll excuse me.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:25.160
Leaving so soon?

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:31.330
I was sure you'd come
to ask me a favor of some sort.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:36.330
No. I doubt you'd hear me out,
so I have changed my mind.

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:40.910
Dear me! But you haven't asked me anything yet!

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:47.660
So what is it? Can't you bear
to ask your useless mother?

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.080
Give it a try.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:53.620
It's been nine years since fleeing Sho for Chin.

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:57.330
Perhaps something has changed,
in some small way.

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:08.160
Although I am King, my own shortcomings mean

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:11.040
the true power lies with Minister Ryo Fui.

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:16.830
I am engaged in an ongoing bitter
power struggle with him as I speak.

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.750
Please, Mother,

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:22.160
lend me the support of the Inner Palace.

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:33.790
Understood.

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:36.370
You may leave...

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:40.580
...and you may look forward
to my response to follow.

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:56.500
Um... may I ask Your Highness something?

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:58.250
What is it?

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:01.080
I have heard the rumors...

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:04.370
Rumors that Your Highness has a benefactor.

00:23:04.370 --> 00:23:05.910
A benefactor?

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:09.540
Someone named... Hika, was it?

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Cursed Prince"
